## Key Design Decisions

| Aspect | Consideration |
|--------|---------------|
| **Decorator vs. Inheritance** | Decorator pattern (composition over inheritance) |
| **Cache Scope** | In-memory by default; can extend to persistent |
| **Expiration** | Time-based and manual invalidation support |
| **Thread Safety** | Use `ConcurrentHashMap` for in-memory; Room handles DB |
| **Flow Integration** | Cache doesn't interfere with Flow-based observation methods |
| **DI Pattern** | Cache injected into decorators; repos injected into VMs |

This architecture keeps concerns separated and allows swapping cache implementations without changing repository interfaces.

